# The project's documents are hand-wrapped prose, and Prettier damages
# them (2026-08-10). Its markdown formatter re-parses plan.md's nested
# sub-tasks as continuation text and folds nine tick-boxes into one
# run-on paragraph — which is exactly what happened to T5.3's and T6.4's
# sub-plans in that day's earlier session. Indenting them differently
# does not help: Prettier then re-nests them one level deeper on every
# run, so the file never settles. CI runs tests and oxlint, never
# Prettier, so nothing needed this formatting; `npm run format` was
# simply corrupting the roadmap in passing. Code stays formatted; prose
# is ours.
*.md
